%% elk.box places nodes but does not route edges. Every edge here relies on the
%% straight-line fallback; without it the render throws on `points.filter`.
%% One edge is labelled: an unrouted edge has no ELK label position either, and
%% an unset one renders as `translate(undefined, NaN)`.
flowchart TD
  A[Start] -->|labelled| B[Middle]
  B --> C[End]
  A --> C
